# Quality and Deterministic CI Contract

## Definition of deterministic green
List the exact commands/jobs required for a merge candidate.

```text
format/check:
lint:
typecheck:
unit tests:
integration tests:
smoke/browser tests:
build/package:
security/dependency audit:
```

