## Flaky-test policy
A flaky required test is a defect to fix or explicitly quarantine through reviewed policy; it is not permission to ignore red CI.

## Regression policy
Material BLOCKER/MAJOR defects should become durable regressions when technically meaningful.

## Exact-head rule
All required checks for merge must correspond to the same candidate SHA that receives the independent final gate.
